{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04438","headline":"秋园卧病呈晖上人 · 陈子昂","name":"秋园卧病呈晖上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"幽寂旷日遥，林园转清密。\n疲疴澹无豫，独坐泛瑶瑟。\n怀挟万古情，忧虞百年疾。\n绵绵多滞念，忽忽每如失。\n缅想赤松游，高寻白云逸。\n荣吝始都丧，幽人遂贞吉。\n图书纷满床，山水蔼盈室。\n宿昔心所尚，平生自兹毕。\n愿言谁见知，梵筵有同术。\n八月高秋晚，凉风正萧瑟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04438.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04438","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}